            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ce̱tkɛ min la yie̱e̱n deet a luäk ni ciök rɛw kiɛ ŋuɔk ji̱th thok luɔny, inɔ bä, bi kään ni nɛy ti tɔt kä gaat I-thɛ-rɛl ti̱n ciaŋkɛ Tha-mɛ-ria. Tin nyuur kɛ kɔamnikiɛn ti̱n puath puaath kɛnɛ dhaaŋnikiɛn ti̱n da̱p da̱a̱p.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
